<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title><%= title || 'Manutenção' %></title>

<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/img/favicon.png">

<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css">

<style>
:root{
--bg1:#0b1220;
--bg2:#0f1b2d;
--card:#0f172a;
--muted:#94a3b8;
--text:#e5e7eb;
--border:rgba(255,255,255,.10);
--brand:#60a5fa;
--warn:#fbbf24;
--ok:#22c55e;
}
body{
min-height:100vh;
background:
radial-gradient(900px 400px at 15% 15%, rgba(96,165,250,.18), transparent 60%),
radial-gradient(700px 350px at 85% 25%, rgba(251,191,36,.14), transparent 60%),
linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg1), var(--bg2));
color:var(--text);
}
.shell{
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:center;
padding:24px;
}
.cardx{
width:100%;
max-width:820px;
border:1px solid var(--border);
background:rgba(15,23,42,.82);
backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
border-radius:18px;
box-shadow: 0 12px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
overflow:hidden;
}
.top{
padding:22px 22px 0 22px;
display:flex;
align-items:center;
justify-content:space-between;
gap:16px;
}
.brand{
display:flex;
align-items:center;
gap:12px;
min-width:0;
}
.brand img{
width:36px;
height:36px;
object-fit:contain;
}
.brand .name{
font-weight:800;
letter-spacing:.2px;
white-space:nowrap;
overflow:hidden;
text-overflow:ellipsis;
}
.badge-soft{
border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.35);
background:rgba(251,191,36,.12);
color:#fde68a;
border-radius:999px;
padding:6px 10px;
font-size:.85rem;
display:inline-flex;
align-items:center;
gap:8px;
white-space:nowrap;
}
.content{
padding:16px 22px 22px 22px;
}
.title{
font-size:1.75rem;
line-height:1.15;
font-weight:900;
margin:10px 0 10px 0;
}
.subtitle{
color:var(--muted);
margin:0 0 18px 0;
font-size:1.02rem;
}
.panel{
border:1px solid var(--border);
border-radius:14px;
padding:14px 14px;
background:rgba(2,6,23,.35);
}
.k{
color:var(--muted);
font-size:.86rem;
}
.v{
font-weight:800;
}
.hrx{
height:1px;
background:rgba(255,255,255,.08);
margin:14px 0;
}
.btnx{
border-radius:12px;
padding:10px 14px;
}
.btn-whats{
background: rgba(34,197,94,.14);
border: 1px solid rgba(34,197,94,.35);
color: #bbf7d0;
}
.btn-whats:hover{
background: rgba(34,197,94,.18);
border-color: rgba(34,197,94,.55);
color: #dcfce7;
}
.foot{
color:var(--muted);
font-size:.85rem;
display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;
gap:12px;
flex-wrap:wrap;
margin-top:12px;
}
.spinner{
width:18px;height:18px;
border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25);
border-top-color: rgba(96,165,250,.9);
border-radius:50%;
animation: spin 1s linear infinite;
}
@keyframes spin{ to{ transform: rotate(360deg);} }
.small-note{
color: rgba(148,163,184,.92);
font-size:.9rem;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="shell">
<div class="cardx">
<div class="top">
<div class="brand">
<img src="/img/logo.png" alt="Logo">
<div class="name">Controle de Presença</div>
</div>

    <div class="badge-soft" aria-label="Status de manutenção">
      <span class="spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      Manutenção em andamento
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content">
    <div class="title">Voltamos em instantes</div>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Estamos realizando uma atualização para melhorar a estabilidade e a experiência do sistema.
      Durante esse período, o acesso pode ficar temporariamente indisponível.
    </p>

    <div class="panel">
      <div class="row g-3 align-items-center">
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
          <div class="k">Status</div>
          <div class="v">Atualização programada</div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-12 col-md-6">
          <div class="k">Previsão</div>
          <div class="v">Alguns minutos</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hrx"></div>

      <div class="d-flex gap-2 flex-wrap">
        <a class="btn btn-primary btnx" href="javascript:location.reload()">
          <i class="bi bi-arrow-clockwise me-2"></i> Tentar novamente
        </a>

        <a class="btn btn-whats btnx"
           href="https://wa.me/5511997857214"
           target="_blank" rel="noopener">
          <i class="bi bi-whatsapp me-2"></i> Suporte no WhatsApp
        </a>

        <a class="btn btn-outline-light btnx" href="/auth/login">
          <i class="bi bi-shield-lock me-2"></i> Área administrativa
        </a>

        <a class="btn btn-outline-warning btnx" href="/auth/logout">
          <i class="bi bi-door-open me-2"></i> Sair
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-3 small-note">
        Se estiver demorando, aguarde 2–5 minutos e atualize a página.
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="foot">
      <div>Protocolo: HTTP 503</div>
      <div>Em caso de urgência, chame no WhatsApp.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

</div>

<script>
// Auto-retry leve (opcional). Se não quiser, pode remover este bloco.
setTimeout(() => {
try { location.reload(); } catch (e) {}
}, 30000);
</script>
</body>
</html>